# Router-image-ONLY context trim (BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore: applies
# solely to `-f Dockerfile.wllm-router` builds). vendor/ alone is 80+ MB and
# the router image is built with -mod=mod against the module cache instead.
# Do NOT rename this back to a generic .dockerignore: the parent repo's
# create_release.sh mounts this directory as the `wekai-src` named build
# context to compile the full wekai CLI, and a generic ignore that strips
# main.go/cli/benchmark empties that context ("no Go files" build failure,
# 2026-08-09).
vendor
.git
.github
chart
tools
cli
benchmark
llm
config
*.md
main.go
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
